        "description": "Runs one command under /usr/bin/time -l and samples, every 50 ms through libproc, the phys_footprint sum of its process group; SIGKILLs the group's members above the measurement cap. max_rss_gib is /usr/bin/time's maximum resident set size (the largest reaped process); group_peak_footprint_gib is the sampled group sum."
